  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Thinly slice brown onion (see ingredients).\n• Thinly slice pear into wedges.\n• Thinly slice silverbeet.\n• Slice lemon into wedges.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Pick thyme leaves.\n• Roughly chop double cream Brie.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686f3e1969ddbf20131a9bac/step-a5ef3a00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion and sliced mushrooms, stirring, until tender, 6-8 minutes.\n• Add herb & mushroom seasoning, garlic, silverbeet and thyme and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add risotto rice and stir to coat. Add the water (for the rice) and stock concentrate.\n• Bring to the boil, then remove from heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686f3e1969ddbf20131a9bac/step-c2b44910.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer risotto to a baking dish.\n• Cover tightly with foil and bake until liquid is absorbed and rice is ‘al dente’, 24-28 minutes.\n• TIP: ‘Al dente’ rice is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686f3e1969ddbf20131a9bac/step-18406120.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When risotto has 10 minutes remaining, wash out frying pan and return to medium-high heat with the butter.\n• Cook pear wedges, turning occasionally, until softened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Reduce heat to medium-low, then add the balsamic vinegar, brown sugar and water (for the pear) and cook until dark and sticky, 3-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686f3e1969ddbf20131a9bac/step-5f98a430.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Remove risotto from oven and stir through chopped Brie until melted.\n• Stir in a good squeeze of lemon juice until combined. Season to taste with salt and pepper.\n• TIP: Stir through a splash of water to loosen risotto if needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686f3e1969ddbf20131a9bac/step-f38e0940.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Brie and mushroom risotto between bowls. Top with caramelised pears and garnish with Parmesan cheese and pine nuts.\n• Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686f3e1969ddbf20131a9bac/step-91828a50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
